\n                \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n                \"itemOffered\": {\r\n                  \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n                  \"name\": \"Advance Panel AC Repair\"\r\n                }\r\n              },\r\n              {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n                \"itemOffered\": {\r\n                  \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n                  \"name\": \"Advance Chiller Panel Repair\"\r\n                }\r\n              },\r\n              {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n                \"itemOffered\": {\r\n                  \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n                  \"name\": \"Advance VFD Panel Service\"\r\n                }\r\n              }\r\n            ]\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n          \"mainEntity\": [\r\n            {\r\n              \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n              \"name\": \"What is an Advance Panel AC?\",\r\n              \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                \"text\": \"An Advance Panel AC is a specialized air conditioning unit designed to cool electrical and electronic control panels. These are crucial for preventing overheating in industrial machinery, servers, and automation systems, ensuring their longevity and reliable operation.\"\r\n              }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n              \"name\": \"How much does Advance panel AC repair cost?\",\r\n              \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                \"text\": \"The Advance panel AC repair cost varies based on the issue. A basic service might start from ₹1,500, while complex issues like compressor or PCB repair can be higher. We provide a transparent AC panel repair estimate before starting any work.\"\r\n              }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Do you offer a guarantee on your repair services?\",\r\n              \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                \"text\": \"Yes, absolutely. We provide a 3-month guarantee on all our services and any parts we replace. This is our commitment to quality and your peace of mind.\"\r\n              }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Are your technicians certified?\",\r\n              \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                \"text\": \"Yes, our team consists of highly skilled, certified, and experienced technicians who are experts in industrial AC panel maintenance and repair. They are trained to handle all major brands and complex systems.\"\r\n              }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Do you provide 24/7 emergency service?\",\r\n              \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                \"text\": \"Yes, we understand that panel AC failures can halt your operations. That's why we offer 24/7 emergency repair for industrial AC panels across Vadodara and surrounding GIDCs.\"\r\n              }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"Which brands of panel ACs do you service?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"We service all major brands of panel ACs and chillers, including Rittal, Schneider, Siemens, and many others. Our technicians are equipped to handle repair for Advance PLC controls and various other proprietary systems.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"What are common signs that my panel AC needs repair?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"Common signs include the panel tripping frequently, inadequate cooling, unusual noises, water leakage, or error codes on the display. If you notice any of these, it's best to call for a professional HVAC control panel troubleshooting.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"Can you repair chiller control boards?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"Yes, we specialize in chiller circuit board diagnostics and repair. We offer affordable chiller control repair to save you the cost of a full board replacement.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"Do you offer an Annual Maintenance Contract (AMC)?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"Yes, we offer a comprehensive Annual maintenance contract for chiller control panels and panel ACs. An AMC is a cost-effective way to ensure your systems run efficiently and prevent unexpected breakdowns.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"I need an Advance panel AC service near me. Which areas do you cover?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"We serve all of Vadodara and major GIDCs across Gujarat, including Makarpura, Nandesari, Savli (Manjusar), and Waghodia. We are the leading Vadodara industrial AC panel experts.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"How quickly can a technician arrive?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"For emergency calls within Vadodara, we aim to have a technician at your site within a few hours. We prioritize rapid response to minimize your downtime.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"What is included in a standard service?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"A standard service includes cleaning the indoor and outdoor units, checking refrigerant levels, inspecting electrical components, cleaning filters, and a full system diagnostics check to ensure optimal performance.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"How can I get a quote?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"You can get a free, no-obligation quote by calling us at +91-9727257141, emailing hello@atlasaircons.com, or filling out the form on our website. We believe in transparent AC panel repair pricing.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"What is the difference between a panel AC and a chiller?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"A panel AC uses refrigerant to directly cool the air inside an enclosure. A chiller uses a refrigeration cycle to cool a liquid (like water or glycol), which is then circulated to cool equipment. We are experts in both Advance panel AC repair and chiller panel repair service.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"Why is my CNC machine panel overheating?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"Overheating in a CNC machine panel is often due to a malfunctioning panel cooler. Our CNC machine panel cooler repair service can diagnose and fix the issue, whether it's a refrigerant leak, a faulty fan, or a clogged filter, protecting your valuable machinery.\"\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n          ]\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"HowTo\",\r\n          \"name\": \"How to get your Advance Panel AC or Chiller Repaired\",\r\n          \"step\": [\r\n            {\r\n              \"@type\": \"HowToStep\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Step 1: Contact Us\",\r\n              \"text\": \"Call us at +91-9727257141 or fill out our online form to describe the issue. Provide details about your equipment and the problem you're facing.\",\r\n              \"url\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/advance-panel-ac-service-center#contact\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"@type\": \"HowToStep\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Step 2: Get a Transparent Quote\",\r\n              \"text\": \"We will provide a clear and upfront AC panel repair estimate. There are no hidden charges. We believe in transparent pricing.\",\r\n              \"url\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/advance-panel-ac-service-center#pricelist\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"@type\": \"HowToStep\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Step 3: Schedule a Visit\",\r\n              \"text\": \"Our certified technician will visit your site at a time convenient for you. We offer 24/7 emergency service for urgent needs.\",\r\n              \"url\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/advance-panel-ac-service-center#contact\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"@type\": \"HowToStep\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Step 4: Expert Repair & Guarantee\",\r\n              \"text\": \"Our expert performs the repair using genuine parts. All our work is backed by a 3-month guarantee for your complete satisfaction.\",\r\n              \"url\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/advance-panel-ac-service-center#why-choose-us\"\r\n            }\r\n          ]\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"@type\": \"ItemList\",\r\n            \"name\": \"Service Price List\",\r\n            \"itemListElement\": [\r\n                {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\r\n                    \"position\": 1,\r\n                    \"item\": {\r\n                        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n                        \"name\": \"Panel AC Inspection/Visiting Charge\",\r\n                        \"priceSpecification\": {\r\n                            \"@type\": \"UnitPriceSpecification\",\r\n                            \"price\": \"500\",\r\n                            \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    }\r\n                },\r\n                {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\r\n                    \"position\": 2,\r\n                    \"item\": {\r\n                        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n                        \"name\": \"Panel AC General Service\",\r\n                        \"priceSpecification\": {\r\n                            \"@type\": \"UnitPriceSpecification\",\r\n                            \"price\": \"1500\",\r\n                            \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    }\r\n                },\r\n                {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\r\n                    \"position\": 3,\r\n                    \"item\": {\r\n                        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n                        \"name\": \"Chiller Panel Repair Service\",\r\n                        \"priceSpecification\": {\r\n                            \"@type\": \"UnitPriceSpecification\",\r\n                            \"price\": \"2500\",\r\n                            \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\",\r\n                            \"priceType\": \"StartingPrice\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    }\r\n                },\r\n                {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\r\n                    \"position\": 4,\r\n                    \"item\": {\r\n                        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n                        \"name\": \"VFD Panel Service\",\r\n                        \"priceSpecification\": {\r\n                            \"@type\": \"UnitPriceSpecification\",\r\n                            \"price\": \"3000\",\r\n                            \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\",\r\n                            \"priceType\": \"StartingPrice\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    }\r\n                }\r\n            ]\r\n        }\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n    </script></p>\r\n<main><!-- Hero Section -->\r\n<section class=\"hero-gradient pt-20 pb-10\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center md:text-left\">\r\n<h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-800 leading-tight\">Gujarat&#8217;s #1 <span class=\"text-amber-500\">Advance Panel AC and Chiller Repair</span> Service Center</h1>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600\">Critical equipment overheating? Get immediate, expert solutions with our <strong>24/7 emergency repair for industrial AC panels</strong>. We offer <strong>transparent AC panel repair pricing</strong> and a 3-month service guarantee.</p>\r\n<div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center md:justify-start\"><a class=\"bg-black text-amber-400 font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg cta-button text-lg\" href=\"#pricing\">View Service Charges</a> <a class=\"bg-white text-black border border-black font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg cta-button text-lg\" href=\"#contact\">Get a Free Quote</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-2xl w-full h-auto\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/advance-panel-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Advance panel ac repair service by expert technicians\" title=\"\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Why Choose Us Section -->\r\n<section id=\"why-choose-us\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 text-center\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">Why We Are The <span class=\"text-amber-500\">Best Service Center for Advance Panel AC Repair</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Your industrial operations can&#8217;t afford downtime. We provide the fastest, most reliable service to keep your systems cool and running.</p>\r\n<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><!-- Feature 1 -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-amber-100 text-amber-500 rounded-full p-3 inline-block mb-4\"> </div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Certified Technicians</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Our team comprises industry-certified experts in <strong>industrial AC panel maintenance</strong> and repair.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Feature 2 -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-amber-100 text-amber-500 rounded-full p-3 inline-block mb-4\"> </div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">3-Month Guarantee</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">We stand by our work with a comprehensive 3-month guarantee on all services and parts.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Feature 3 -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-amber-100 text-amber-500 rounded-full p-3 inline-block mb-4\"> </div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">24/7 Emergency Service</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Breakdowns don&#8217;t wait. We offer <strong>24/7 emergency repair for industrial AC panels</strong> to minimize your downtime.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Feature 4 -->\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-amber-100 text-amber-500 rounded-full p-3 inline-block mb-4\"> </div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Transparent Pricing</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Get a clear <strong>AC panel repair estimate</strong> before we start. No hidden fees, just honest work.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Our Services Section -->\r\n<section id=\"services\" class=\"py-16\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">Our Core Repair &amp; Service Offerings</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">From <strong>Advance VFD panel service</strong> to complex <strong>chiller circuit board diagnostics</strong>, we handle it all.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><!-- Service 1 -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-white\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Advance-panel-ac-service-center.webp\" alt=\"Advance panel AC service center\" title=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Advance Panel AC Repair</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Complete service for <strong>control panel air conditioner repair</strong>, including <strong>electrical panel AC service</strong> for all major brands.</p>\r\n<span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-amber-600\">Starting from ₹1500</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Service 2 -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-white\">\r\n<div class=\"svg-container\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Advance Chiller Panel Repair</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Specialized <strong>chiller panel repair service</strong>, including <strong>commercial chiller control board repair</strong> and PLC troubleshooting.</p>\r\n<span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-amber-600\">Starting from ₹2500</