ref=\"#\">Fatehganj</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Gorwa</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Gorwa BIDC</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Gotri</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Harni</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Karelibaug</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Makarpura</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Makarpura GIDC</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Maneja</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Manjalpur</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Nandesari GIDC</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">New VIP Road</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Nizampura</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Old Padra Road</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Por-Ramangamdi GIDC</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Race Course</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Ranoli GIDC</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Sama-Savli Road</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Sayajigunj</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Tarsali</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Vasna-Bhayli Road</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Waghodia GIDC</a> <a class=\"block hover:text-amber-600 p-1\" href=\"#\">Waghodia Road</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Video and Error Codes Section -->\r\n<section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\r\n<div>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">See Our Experts in Action</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">Watch how our technicians perform a detailed <strong>industrial AC panel maintenance</strong> check. We believe in transparency and educating our clients.</p>\r\n<div class=\"aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg\"><video class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" poster=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Advance-panel-ac-service-center.webp\" controls=\"controls\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\">\r\n                            <source src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Advance-ac-repair.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" />\r\n                            Your browser does not support the video tag.\r\n                        </video></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Common Error Codes &amp; Solutions</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">Facing an error? Here&#8217;s a quick guide on <strong>how to fix a malfunctioning electrical panel AC</strong>. For complex issues, always call a professional.</p>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4\"><details class=\"faq-item bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold\">Error E1: High-Pressure Protection</summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\"><strong>Cause:</strong> Blocked condenser coil, fan failure, or overcharged refrigerant. <br /><strong>Solution:</strong> Clean the condenser. Check fan operation. If the issue persists, call us for pressure diagnostics.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"faq-item bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold\">Error E2: Anti-Freezing Protection</summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\"><strong>Cause:</strong> Low refrigerant, dirty filter, or low airflow. <br /><strong>Solution:</strong> Clean or replace the air filter. If the problem continues, it may be a refrigerant leak requiring expert <strong>panel AC unit repair</strong>.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"faq-item bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold\">Error E4: Compressor Discharge Temp. High</summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-600\"><strong>Cause:</strong> Refrigerant shortage or compressor issue. <br /><strong>Solution:</strong> This is a critical error. Turn off the unit immediately and call for <strong>emergency repair for industrial AC panels</strong> to prevent compressor damage.</p>\r\n</details></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- FAQ Section -->\r\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-16\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Got questions? We have answers. Here&#8217;s everything you need to know about our <strong>Advance panel ac service center</strong>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4\"><details class=\"faq-item bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold text-lg\">What is an Advance Panel AC?</summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">An Advance Panel AC is a specialized air conditioning unit designed to cool electrical and electronic control panels. These are crucial for preventing overheating in industrial machinery, servers, and automation systems, ensuring their longevity and reliable operation.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"faq-item bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold text-lg\">How much does <strong>Advance panel AC repair cost</strong>?</summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">The <strong>Advance panel AC repair cost</strong> varies based on the issue. A basic service might start from ₹1,500, while complex issues like compressor or PCB repair can be higher. We provide a transparent <strong>AC panel repair estimate</strong> before starting any work.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"faq-item bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold text-lg\">Do you offer a guarantee on your repair services?</summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">Yes, absolutely. We provide a 3-month guarantee on all our services and any parts we replace. This is our commitment to quality and your peace of mind.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"faq-item bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold text-lg\">Are your technicians certified?</summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">Yes, our team consists of highly skilled, certified, and experienced technicians who are experts in <strong>industrial AC panel maintenance</strong> and repair. They are trained to handle all major brands and complex systems.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"faq-item bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold text-lg\">Do you provide <strong>24/7 emergency service</strong>?</summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">Yes, we understand that panel AC failures can halt your operations. That&#8217;s why we offer <strong>24/7 emergency repair for industrial AC panels</strong> across Vadodara and surrounding GIDCs.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"faq-item bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold text-lg\">I need an <strong>Advance panel AC service near me</strong>. Which areas do you cover?</summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">We serve all of Vadodara and major GIDCs across Gujarat, including Makarpura, Nandesari, Savli (Manjusar), and Waghodia. We are the leading <strong>Vadodara industrial AC panel experts</strong>.</p>\r\n</details></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</main><!-- Popup Container -->\r\n<div id=\"popup-overlay\" class=\"popup-overlay\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n<div class=\"popup-content\"><span id=\"popup-close-btn\" class=\"popup-close\">×</span>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-amber-500\">Need Urgent Help?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">Get a FREE, no-obligation quote from our experts now!</p>\r\n<form id=\"popup-form\"><input class=\"w-full p-3 mb-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-400\" name=\"name\" required=\"\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your Name\" /> <input class=\"w-full p-3 mb-4 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ou